# Naming conventions

| Context | Convention | Example |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Python modules | `snake_case.py` | `job_normalizer.py` |
| SQLAlchemy models | `PascalCase` class | `class JobPosting` |
| Pydantic schemas | `PascalCase` + intent suffix | `TrackCreate`, `TrackRead`, `TrackUpdate` |
| Vue components | `PascalCase.vue` | `JobCard.vue` |
| Composables | `useX.ts` (kebab-case file ok in `composables/` per Nuxt auto-import: `useJobs.ts`) | `useJobs.ts` |
| TS files (lib, schemas, stores) | `kebab-case.ts` | `job-schema.ts`, `track-store.ts` |
| Nuxt pages | file-route convention, kebab-case segments | `pages/jobs/[id].vue` |
| Extension entrypoints | WXT convention | `entrypoints/sidepanel/` |

`pnpm run check:filenames` enforces this (`scripts/dev/check-filename-conventions.sh`).
